Straight-ray demonstration: uniform atmosphere and rigid horizontal ground.
True AirAbsorption
20 TemperatureC
70 RelativeHumidity          - percent, not fraction
101325 PressurePa
343 SoundSpeed               - m/s for reflected-path phase
0 GroundZ                    - global m
rigid GroundModel            - none, rigid, impedance
10 ImpedanceReal             - Z/(rho c), only used for impedance ground
-10 ImpedanceImag            - exp(+i omega t) convention
0 NumScreens                 - optional rows x1 y1 x2 y2 top_z, in global m
